            "review_text": "travelholics2016\nSingapore, Singapore1 contribution\n0\nAwesome Decoration\nMar 2016\nImpressed by a unique design bringing street harmony into space and furniture, Ngon Pho is all three regions where the contemporary and tradition mix on a road.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 8, 2016\nNgon Garden HN\nHi TravelHolics2016,\n\nThe sound is good when you mentioned about what impressed you at Ngon Pho Restaurant.\n\nMany thanks for your positive reviews. We really appreciate that and will try our best to make Ngon Pho better day by day.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you again soon at Ngon Pho - Aeon Mall Long Bien or other branches of Quan An Ngon Restaurant Chain (72 Nguyen Trai - Vincom Royal City, 25T2 Hoang Dao Thuy, 34 Phan Dinh Phung and 18 Phan Boi Chau).\n\nMoreover, you may make a reservation via this hotline: 0903.246.963/ 090.222.8494 before coming to Quan An Ngon restaurants or 090.222.7475 before coming back Ngon Pho to let our staffs serve you best.\n\nThanks and Regards,\n\nSincerely,\nNgon Pho Restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
